_text","block_id":"EPqv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2B10F033-7000-4BEB-8C68-41E6ED97A23B","type":"message","user":"U01F9KGKAGP","text":"ちょっとやってみましたが書き方難しいですね\n恐れ入りますが設定内容教えていただけましたら幸いです。。","ts":"1630084189.114500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eYx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43c6fd2c-8e0c-4779-9608-4c3da83da486","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私は再帰化する時に実行してほしくなかったのでレジスタを直接書き換えるようにしています","ts":"1630082678.112400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"18O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BA4539FD-B15B-4B8C-A915-500F6159D0A0","type":"message","user":"U01F9KGKAGP","text":"たしかに　テストしていれば問題ないですね\n\u0026lt;leader\u0026gt;Q あたりをqQ@qq@Q にマップすればいいのか…","ts":"1630082358.111300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RtP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8689e6e0-48de-46a3-a44b-f0f0163ca493","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"同じ話だけど、長大な自動生成ファイルの一部に違うフォーマットが含まれていてそこから後ろが…","ts":"1630077558.108500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"innocent","count":3,"users":["U03C71D7H","U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JrlK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1ee0f96-dce7-4d06-983a-fcedfab8107c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"1000 じゃ足りない場合もある…再帰していればその心配もなし！","ts":"1630077422.107100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dizzy","count":1,"users":["U01F9KGKAGP"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O5H6j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3b8cc35-f6dc-4251-be7c-0da6c2999e14","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"長大な自動生成ファイルを`cgn.n.`とポチポチしてたら疲れたので`1000@q`したらまだ残っててバグらせたことがある","ts":"1630077355.106000","edited":{"user":"U01D9BALEKU","ts":"1630077410.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oXs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"abb2bef0-a12c-4b1d-9f9e-14d906b0b4c1","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"「`@q` よし動いた。もう一度 `@q` 大丈夫そう。では再帰に変換して… undo して(?) 全体に実行！」(必要ないのになぜか試しで実行した部分を undo してしまう)","ts":"1630076681.103200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":6,"users":["U776661HA","U01D9BALEKU","U81LLJ340","U8CC7MDCL","U01F9KGKAGP","U02CLFXL19A"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kp67"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b04f00f3-249b-4795-80fe-79b5c8f11480","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"複雑なマクロになるとちゃんと期待通り動くかどうかなかなか自信が持てなくて、「とりあえず最初の10個だけ試そう」とかなるんですよね。個数指定できるのはそういう意味で便利","ts":"1630076544.101900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IuM"}]}]
